{title: Lied to the Holy Spirit}
{subtitle: Acts 5:1–2; 5:3–4; 5:5–6; 5:7–10; 5:11}
{key: Dm}
{tempo: 70}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Dm] |
| [Dm] | [Am] | [Bb] | [F] [C/E] | ×2

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Dm]A man named Ananias stood with his [Am]wife
They [Bb]sold a piece of property to the church [F]
[Dm]With Sapphira's knowledge he held back the [Am]price
Laying only a por[Bb]tion at the apostles' [Dm]feet
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
You have [Bb]not lied to men but to [F]God
Satan filled your [C]heart with a deadly [Dm]lie
The money [Bb]was yours before the sale was [F]made
Why contrive this [C]thing in your heart so [Dm]deep
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Peter spoke the truth with a Spirit's [Am]eye
[Bb]Why lie to the Holy Spirit's pre[F]sence here
[Dm]While it remained unsold it was [Am]your own
After it was [Bb]sold the cash was yours to [Dm]keep
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
When Ananias heard these words he fell [Am]down and died
[Bb]Great fear seized all who heard the tragic [F]tale [Fmaj7]
[Dm]The young men rose and wrapped the body [Am]tight
Carrying him [Bb]out to bury him in the [Dm]ground
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
About [Bb]three hours later Sapphira came [F]in
Not [C]knowing what had befallen [Dm]her husband [C]
[Bb]Peter asked the price she said it was [F]true
But the feet of the mourn[C]ers stood at the [Dm]door [C]
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[Dm]At once she fell down at his feet and [Am]died
[Bb]Found dead by the young men who [F]carried her out
[Dm]They buried her beside her husband in the [Am]earth
Great [Bb]fear came over the whole church of [Dm]faith
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
You have [Bb]not lied to men but to [F]God
Satan filled your [C]heart with a deadly [Dm]lie
[C6]The money [Bb]was yours before the sale was [F]made
Why contrive this [C]thing in your heart so [Dm]deep
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
Great [C]fear came [Bb]over all who [Dm]heard of it
A [Bb]warning for the new community of [Dm]faith
{end_of_verse}

